flowchart TB
    Self[Self-signed Issuer] --> Root[Root CA Certificate and Secret]
    Root --> Issuer[CA Issuer]
    Issuer --> Node[node-tls]
    Issuer --> Admin[admin-tls]
    Issuer --> Beat[filebeat-tls]
    Issuer --> Dash[dashboard-tls]
    Node --> Index[Indexer pods]
    Admin --> Hook[Security hook Job]
    Beat --> Managers[Manager pods]
    Dash --> UI[Dashboard pods<br/>Optional HTTPS]
